@Api = http://localhost:5080

### Smoke test
GET {{Api}}/api/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

### Smoke test with your own correlation ID (echoed in X-Correlation-ID and in the logs)
GET {{Api}}/api/v1/ping
X-Correlation-ID: my-debug-session-1

### Error format: unknown route -> 404 ProblemDetails with correlationId
GET {{Api}}/api/v1/does-not-exist

### Liveness: is the process up? (no dependency checks)
GET {{Api}}/health/live

### Readiness: are SQL Server and Redis reachable? 503 if not
GET {{Api}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only). Interactive explorer: {{Api}}/scalar
GET {{Api}}/openapi/v1.json
